      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A non-mindless creature enters a space adjacent to a cerebinite</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Initiative hasn't yet been rolled</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cerebinite automatically notices the creature, makes a crystalline growth Strike against one creature adjacent to itself, then rolls initiative.</p>",
