        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p>When the cerebinite dies, it explodes in a blast fueled by the memories stored in its crystalline body, affecting all creatures in a 30ft Emanation. Each creature in the area (including other cerebinites) must succeed at a DC 22 Will Saving Throw save or take 2d8 Mental Damage damage and become Stunned 1 (or double damage and Stunned 2 on a critical failure).</p>",
